      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "DiT360 / FLUX - Baseline (no RoPE, no circular padding)\\n\\nGoal: maximum image stability/quality. Seam is handled only by optional edge blending.\\n\\nWhat to change:\\n- UNETLoader: set your FLUX model file (fp8 vs full).\\n- LoraLoaderModelOnly: set your DiT360 LoRA file + strength.\\n- VAELoader: set your VAE file.\\n- Prompts + seed/steps/cfg.\\n\\nTips:\\n- Start with Equirect360KSampler.circular_padding = 0 and Equirect360VAEDecode.circular_padding = 0.\\n- If you see a seam, increase EdgeBlender.blend_width (10-40)."
      ],
      "color": "#263",
      "bgcolor": "#385"
    },
    {
